<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Federal Express raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Federal Express raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst Kevin Murphy on Wednesday raised his rating for Federal Express Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 1-5/8 to 48-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
